characters in this DLC on time  restraints I have a feeling they would  have done it if they could I'm also  going to be doing a separate video on  the ending we get after we collect all  the crowns my short review of collecting  all the crowns in every piece of DLC is  that it raises as many questions as it  answers and unfortunately that leaves a  lot of gaps in the law that we were  hoping would be explained and that I am  hoping will be answered in future DLCs  although I'm not holding my breath for  any more DLC in the end though all three  pieces of DLC are incredible value if  you enjoyed Dark Souls 2 you'll enjoy  them if you enjoyed Dark Souls 1 you'll  especially enjoy them because I think  that every one of them offers something  to a different player  I think they stand out significantly in  terms of quality from the base game but  I'm curious why do you think that is is  it the level design that's complex and  has short cuts rather than straight  paths is it the bosses that have a  really unique element to each one of  them maybe it was the overall  presentation let me know in the comments  below I'm really curious to know what  you think there's also a poll you can  vote in in the description and I  encourage you to look at it to see what  other people in the community think  about the DLC results from the last poll  show that most people rated the iron  crown DLC a 9 or an 8 out of 10 and I'd  really like to see how you think the  ivory crown matches up because community  votes are really important too it's not  just my opinion but other than that guys  thanks for watching I'll see you in the  next one and I promise more good stuff  is on the way bye bye
 

